    {
      "id": "us2vWjvSUWBhe2JntHsgT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2390.833333333331,
      "y": 807.9999999999993,
      "width": 939.767578125,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1102388416,
      "version": 179,
      "versionNonce": 952380608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786507567811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Bikin training event (judul, deskripsi, mode\noffline/online, tanggal mulai-selesai, lokasi/meeting\nURL)\n2. Edit/hapus event yang dibuat departemennya\nsendiri\n3. Tunjuk trainer (pilih dari employee terdaftar via\ntrainer_id)\n4. Opsional: link event ke course LMS yang sudah ada\n(course_id) — buat reuse materi & test",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Bikin training event (judul, deskripsi, mode offline/online, tanggal mulai-selesai, lokasi/meeting URL)\n2. Edit/hapus event yang dibuat departemennya sendiri\n3. Tunjuk trainer (pilih dari employee terdaftar via trainer_id)\n4. Opsional: link event ke course LMS yang sudah ada (course_id) — buat reuse materi & test",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NUEg1scx51nnLlhsm-Q2Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2394.833333333331,
      "y": 1297.9999999999993,
      "width": 939.767578125,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDAV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 160061248,
      "version": 251,
      "versionNonce": 1084841152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786507777215,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Upload materi native langsung ke event\n(training_materials) — kalau gak mau/gak bisa reuse\ndari LMS.\n2. Materi bisa berbagai tipe konten (dokumen, video,\nlink eksternal)\n3. Atur urutan materi (sort_order)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Upload materi native langsung ke event (training_materials) — kalau gak mau/gak bisa reuse dari LMS.\n2. Materi bisa berbagai tipe konten (dokumen, video, link eksternal)\n3. Atur urutan materi (sort_order)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ALfpP9h-pogMtUzKkaV4w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2390.833333333331,
      "y": 1649.9999999999993,
      "width": 939.767578125,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDAl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 205283136,
      "version": 313,
      "versionNonce": 1063345984,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786507942608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Bikin pre-test dan/atau post-test per event\n(assessments dengan type = pre_test/post_test)\n2. Setting passing score, jumlah percobaan maksimal,\ndurasi pengerjaan\n3. Setting apakah test boleh dikerjakan anonim\n(allow_anonymous) + generate link publik\n(public_token)\n4. Kalau event referensi ke course LMS → test-nya\notomatis pakai assessment yang sudah ada di course\ntersebut (redirect, bukan bikin baru)\n5. Tambah soal (pilihan ganda / esai), atur poin per\nsoal",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Bikin pre-test dan/atau post-test per event (assessments dengan type = pre_test/post_test)\n2. Setting passing score, jumlah percobaan maksimal, durasi pengerjaan\n3. Setting apakah test boleh dikerjakan anonim (allow_anonymous) + generate link publik (public_token)\n4. Kalau event referensi ke course LMS → test-nya otomatis pakai assessment yang sudah ada di course tersebut (redirect, bukan bikin baru)\n5. Tambah soal (pilihan ganda / esai), atur poin per soal",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "H8limgowVgmx6FMsI7rYp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2402.833333333331,
      "y": 2267.999999999999,
      "width": 939.767578125,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDAt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1242733760,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 1786785600,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786507977594,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Kelola daftar peserta event (event_participants)\n2. Catat kehadiran — baik peserta terdaftar\n(user_id) maupun peserta tamu/eksternal (input nama\nmanual, participant_name)\n3. Update status peserta\n(invited/confirmed/attended/absent)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Kelola daftar peserta event (event_participants)\n2. Catat kehadiran — baik peserta terdaftar (user_id) maupun peserta tamu/eksternal (input nama manual, participant_name)\n3. Update status peserta (invited/confirmed/attended/absent)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
