      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A. Management Event :\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. Management Event :\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fFDkCX5g5OBy6aaEMxKSs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3548.833333333331,
      "y": 763.9999999999993,
      "width": 1069.1826171875,
      "height": 1215,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDCV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1911830336,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 1276374208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786509394888,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. Bikin course baru (judul, deskripsi, status)\n2. Edit/hapus course yang dibuat departemennya sendiri\n3. Setting akses per departemen — pilih departemen mana\naja yang boleh akses course ini (course_departments, many-\nto-many — bisa cross-department, bukan cuma departemen\nsendiri)\n\n\n1. Tambah materi ke dalam course, bisa berupa:\n   Single-page (course cuma punya 1 lesson)\n   Multi-bab (banyak lesson berurutan, sort_order)\n2. Atur tipe konten per lesson (dokumen, video, link\neksternal)\n3. Tandai lesson yang wajib diselesaikan (is_required)\n\n\n1. Bikin test di akhir course (assessments dengan course_id\natau lesson_id)\n2. Setting passing score, jumlah percobaan maksimal, durasi\nTambah soal & pilihan jawaban, atur poin per soal.\n3. Bikin agar user bisa input jawaban dengan upload jawaban \npakai Excel (csv)\n\n\n1. Assign/enroll employee ke course tertentu\n(course_enrollments.assigned_by)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. Bikin course baru (judul, deskripsi, status)\n2. Edit/hapus course yang dibuat departemennya sendiri\n3. Setting akses per departemen — pilih departemen mana aja yang boleh akses course ini (course_departments, many-to-many — bisa cross-department, bukan cuma departemen sendiri)\n\n\n1. Tambah materi ke dalam course, bisa berupa:\n   Single-page (course cuma punya 1 lesson)\n   Multi-bab (banyak lesson berurutan, sort_order)\n2. Atur tipe konten per lesson (dokumen, video, link eksternal)\n3. Tandai lesson yang wajib diselesaikan (is_required)\n\n\n1. Bikin test di akhir course (assessments dengan course_id atau lesson_id)\n2. Setting passing score, jumlah percobaan maksimal, durasi\nTambah soal & pilihan jawaban, atur poin per soal.\n3. Bikin agar user bisa input jawaban dengan upload jawaban \npakai Excel (csv)\n\n\n1. Assign/enroll employee ke course tertentu (course_enrollments.assigned_by)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
